  "content": "<p>The following table includes a selection of the course assignments. Some problems include solutions.</p>\n<p><table>\n\n<thead>\n\n<tr>\n\n<th>\n\nLEC #\n</th>\n\n<th>\n\nLECTURE TOPICS\n</th>\n\n<th>\n\nEXERCISES\n</th>\n</p>\n</tr>\n\n<p></thead>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n1\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\nThe two-body problem\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n(<a href=\"../../resources/ex_01/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n2\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\nThe two-body problem (cont.)\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n(<a href=\"../../resources/ex_02/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n3\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\nBarker&rsquo;s equation and Kepler&rsquo;s equation\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n(<a href=\"../../resources/ex_03/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n4\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\nThe initial-value problem\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n(<a href=\"../../resources/ex_04/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n5\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\nEuler angles\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n(<a href=\"../../resources/ex_05/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n6\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\nThe orbital boundary-value problem (BVP)\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n(<a href=\"../../resources/ex_06/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n7\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\nOptimum orbital transfer\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n(<a href=\"../../resources/ex_07/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n8\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\nAnalytical and geometric properties of the BVP\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n(<a href=\"../../resources/ex_08/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n9\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\nLambert&rsquo;s theorem and the Lagrange time equation\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n(<a href=\"../../resources/ex_09/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n10\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\nTransformation of the BVP\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n(<a href=\"../../resources/ex_10/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n12\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\nPatched conics and planetary flybys\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n(<a href=\"../../resources/ex_12/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n14\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\nHypergeometric functions and continued fractions\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n(<a href=\"../../resources/ex_14/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n18\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\nPreliminary orbit determination using Taylor series\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n(<a href=\"../../resources/ex_18/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n22\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\nThe covariance, information, and estimator matrices\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n(<a href=\"../../resources/ex_22/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n26\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\nThe Clohessy-Wiltshire equations of relative motion\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n(<a href=\"../../resources/ex_26/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n<p></tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td>\n\n33\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\nRunge-Kutta method of numerical integration\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\n(<a href=\"../../resources/ex_33/index.html\">PDF</a>)\n</td>\n</p>\n</tr>\n\n</table>\n\n",
